sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Home App
    participant Core as Home Core / home-control
    participant HA as Home Assistant

    App->>Core: GET /v1/home-control/devices/{temperature}/history
    Core->>HA: GET /api/states
    HA-->>Core: Entité d’humidité associée
    Core->>HA: GET /api/history/period (température, humidité)
    HA-->>Core: Séries de relevés
    Core-->>App: Mesures normalisées sur 24 h
